<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσόω, ὁ μεσάζων τόπος</span>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νησίζων</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότερον ἄρχοιτο τὸ πάθος ἢ μεσάζοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτὸς μεσαζούσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					18.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσαζούσης ἡμέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					7.5.2
				</span></i>
			; of food, <i>to be half-cooked</i>, Bilabel <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀψαρτ</span>.<i><span class="en">
				p.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be inserted in the middle, intervene</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μεσαζόμεναι λέξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					270.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Conj.</u>
				255.20
			</span></i>; of terms in an arithmetical series, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>occupy a central position</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γῆν ὁ μῦθος λέγει μεσάζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1389.38
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
